        <h1>Microbiological Investigations of the Mir Space Station and Flight Crew</h1>
        <div class="meta-id">Record ID: 9400590</div>
      </div>

      <div class="content">
        <div class="action-banner">
          <div class="action-banner-text">
            <strong>Official Source:</strong> National Aeronautics and Space Administration Life Sciences Data Archive
          </div>
          <a href="https://nlsp.nasa.gov/search/data/details/8c0e6106-fb22-5b20-ad8d-3f61dceec867?dataType=EXPERIMENTS" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="btn">
            View Official Record on NASA NLSP &rarr;
